ss=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">q</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>J</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M\\ddot{\\boldsymbol{q}} + \\boldsymbol{h} = S^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\tau} + J_c^\\top\\boldsymbol{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">h</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、摩擦锥、关节力矩与速度上限。解出后由动力学方程反算关节力矩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。WBC 的价值在于&quot;同时&quot;&quot;按优先级&quot;处理这一切，取代了上一代手工的足端力分配（参见 <a href=\"../legged/biped-quadruped-control\">双足与四足控制</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型预测控制-滚动时域与简化模型\">模型预测控制：滚动时域与简化模型</h2><p>WBC 只看当下，无法回答&quot;现在该不该提前减速，因为三步后有个坎&quot;。MPC 引入<strong>预测时域</strong>：在未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 步上，用动力学模型预测状态演化，优化一串控制使代价最小，约束全程满足，但只执行第一步，下一控制周期用最新状态重新优化。这种&quot;滚动时域 + 反复重规划&quot;让控制天然具备前瞻性与对扰动的鲁棒性。</p>\n<p>代价是计算量。全模型非线性 MPC 在 kHz 级实时求解很重，工程上常用<strong>简化模型</strong>：单刚体动力学（SRBD）把机器人当成一个带惯量的浮动刚体、忽略腿质量，得到接近凸的 MPC，可在数百 Hz 实时跑——这正是众多四足在线步态调整的主力。当需要更高保真时则上<strong>全身 MPC（WB-MPC）</strong>。2025 年的代表性进展显示，基于 MuJoCo/iLQR 与基于采样的 MPPI 两条路线都已在真实四足上实现实时、接触丰富的全身控制：MPPI 路线（如 RTWholeBodyMPPI）首次在真实四足上用单一采样式 MPC 同时完成运动与操作，并开源了 Unitree Go1 的部署代码；iLQR/MuJoCo 路线则在四足动态行走、四足以两腿站立、乃至全尺寸人形双足行走上验证了实时 WB-MPC。</p>\n<h2 id=\"凸近似-采样与求解器选择\">凸近似、采样与求解器选择</h2><p>MPC 能否实时，关键在如何对付非线性与接触的非光滑。三条主流路线各有取舍：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>凸 MPC</strong>：用 SRBD 等线性化模型把问题化为凸 QP，求解快、可证收敛，但模型失真在剧烈动作下暴露。</li>\n<li><strong>非线性 MPC（DDP/iLQR）</strong>：保留更多非线性，用微分动态规划高效求解，精度高、对求解器实现与初值敏感。</li>\n<li><strong>采样式 MPC（MPPI）</strong>：不需要梯度，靠在 GPU 上并行采样大量控制序列、按代价加权平均，天然能处理接触这类非光滑、不可微的动力学，2025 年已落到真实四足。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论哪条路线，MPC 输出的接触力/轨迹都要交给 WBC 或底层关节控制器执行，而关节能否忠实跟踪指定力，取决于 <a href=\"force-compliant-locomotion\">力控与柔顺运动</a> 的力控能力与驱动透明度。同时，模型驱动方法的精度上限受限于建模误差，这也是 <a href=\"learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a> 兴起的动因——用数据弥补难以建模的接触与扰动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滚动时域为何能抗扰动\">滚动时域为何能抗扰动</h2><p>MPC 的鲁棒性来自一个常被低估的机制：<strong>它从不执行整段优化结果，只执行第一步</strong>。设预测时域为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 步，控制器解出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{u}_0^*, \\dots, \\boldsymbol{u}_{N-1}^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0224em;vertical-align:-0.3337em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">u</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">u</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3337em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，却只把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{u}_0^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9368em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">u</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 发给机器人，下一控制周期（几十毫秒后）用新测到的状态重新解一遍。这意味着任何未建模的扰动、任何模型误差，都会在下一个重规划周期里被新状态吸收并修正——控制器天然具备反馈，而不像&quot;规划一条完整轨迹再跟踪&quot;那样对偏差迟钝。</p>\n<p>代价随之而来：每次重规划都要在线求解一个优化问题，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 越大前瞻越远、计算越重。工程上的取舍可归纳为下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>前瞻能力</th>\n<th>计算负荷</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小（数步）</td>\n<td>仅够维持当前步态</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高频姿态稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中（约一步）</td>\n<td>能提前调整落足</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>四足在线步态调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大（多步）</td>\n<td>能规划整段行走节奏</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>离线轨迹 / 低频规划层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这也解释了为何实际系统常<strong>分层</strong>：低频、大时域的 MPC 规划出未来接触力与机身轨迹，高频、小时域的 WBC 负责把当前目标在毫秒内落成关节力矩。两层各司其职，既拿到前瞻又不牺牲实时性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WBC 解&quot;此刻&quot;——按优先级把多任务映射到全身力矩；MPC 解&quot;未来一段&quot;——滚动时域前瞻优化。</li>\n<li>实际系统常分层：MPC 在数百 Hz 规划接触力与机身轨迹，WBC 在 kHz 落成关节力矩。</li>\n<li>WBC 常用分层 QP，在全身动力学、摩擦锥、关节上限约束下最小化任务误差。</li>\n<li>MPC 靠滚动时域获得前瞻与鲁棒性，代价是计算量，工程上用 SRBD 等简化模型换实时。</li>\n<li>2025 年 iLQR/MuJoCo 与采样式 MPPI 两条路线均在真实四足/人形上实现实时全身 MPC。</li>\n<li>MPC 输出需力控忠实执行，其建模误差上限也催生了学习驱动控制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全身控制与 MPC","id":"全身控制与-mpc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全身控制：优先级任务与二次规划","id":"全身控制-优先级任务与二次规划"},{"level":2,"text":"模型预测控制：滚动时域与简化模型","id":"模型预测控制-滚动时域与简化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"凸近似、采样与求解器选择","id":"凸近似-采样与求解器选择"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动时域为何能抗扰动","id":"滚动时域为何能抗扰动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双足与四足控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/biped-quadruped-control"},"next":{"title":"力控与柔顺运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/force-compliant-locomotion"}}